# Hive storage

Adapters are **checked in** at `sprout_app/lib/core/storage/hive_adapters.dart`. Do not generate them.

- Never reuse or reshuffle `typeId`s (`0` account … `4` budget group). New models get the next unused id and a `HiveBoxes` name.
- `read` order must match `write` order. New fields are **appended**; old rows must still deserialize (see `TransactionHiveAdapter`).
- Map Hive DTOs in `data/mappers/**`, not in presentation.
- More: `.cursor/references/offline-sync.md`.
